sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Extractor Agent
    participant TL as Tool Loop
    participant PI as Page Index
    participant LLM as LLM

    E->>TL: Start extractor with schema and tools
    TL->>LLM: System prompt and task prompt
    LLM->>TL: Call search_pages(query, k)
    TL->>PI: Semantic search on pgvector
    PI-->>TL: Top k matching pages
    TL->>LLM: Return tool result
    LLM->>TL: Call get_page(page_number)
    TL->>PI: Fetch full page text
    PI-->>TL: Full page text
    TL->>LLM: Return tool result
    LLM-->>TL: Final strict JSON
    TL-->>E: Parsed domain object
